  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show your support for the law enforcement community while maintaining rapid access to your waistband carry firearm with Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Blue Line Concealed Carry Hoodie. This black CCW hoodie is crafted from high-performance materials designed to wick away moisture, keeping you cool and dry in various conditions. The concealed carry hoodie features front pass-through pockets that enable quick, ambidextrous access to your waistband, ensuring you are always prepared.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133047",
  "description": "<p>Show your support for the law enforcement community while maintaining rapid access to your waistband carry firearm with Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Blue Line Concealed Carry Hoodie. This black CCW hoodie is crafted from high-performance materials designed to wick away moisture, keeping you cool and dry in various conditions. The concealed carry hoodie features front pass-through pockets that enable quick, ambidextrous access to your waistband, ensuring you are always prepared. Compact utility zip-pockets on each sleeve (4.5 inch x 4.5 inch) provide perfect storage for everyday carry (EDC) items, while a wire pass-through port on the left shoulder pocket accommodates headphones, mics, and more. The hoodie includes a 2-zipper closure for quick and efficient access to your pockets, duty belt, or waistband. Additionally, the right sleeve features a loop patch (4 inch x 4 inch) for adding flags and morale patches. With cuff thumb holes to keep your hands warm and sleeves from riding up, and pen pockets on the left sleeve, this hoodie is designed for first responders, public safety, and more. Proceeds from this purchase benefit families of fallen first responders, adding a meaningful touch to your support.</p>",
